The till shows ${takings} taken and ${sold} items sold from ${dl[0]} to ${dl[dl.length - 1]}. We wasted ${waste} items, most of them ${topWaste} (${topWasteN}).

## Sales

- Takings: ${takings}
- Items sold: ${sold}

## Waste

- Items wasted: ${waste}
- Most waste: ${topWaste}, ${topWasteN} items

## Late payers

${late.map((c) => `- ${c}`).join("\n")}

Jess at Wren Street
`);
